{660}{skeet57}{(More pounding and cackling as you wait some more...)}
{661}{}{(You whistle tunelessly and make shadow-puppets against the back wall of Skeeter's workshop...)}

{670}{skeet58}{There you go. (You wake suddenly as Skeeter takes your weapon from the workbench - you can see a number of small shiny, metal parts lingering on the bench as Skeeter returns your weapon to you.) That *should* do it, I reckon. Give 'er a try.}
{671}{}{Thanks. Can you upgrade any of my other weapons?}
{672}{}{Thanks, Skeeter. Uh, let me ask you something else.}
{673}{}{Thanks, Skeeter. I'll go try it out.}

